Offered rate HELD at 60 000 datagrams/s in all three arms; only the number of distinct 5-tuples
moved, and the flow-table row count (1 -> 5000 -> 1) proves the work really happened.

  arm            keys   sent      socket drops   kernel CPU (core-s / 10 s)   app_drop
