So neither more packets (step 09 reached 654 709/s) nor more work per packet (5000x the distinct
keys) reached the app-level round-robin drop path. `droppedPackets` never left 0 in 9 548 120
offered datagrams across steps 09, 11 and 13. The 1-key arms either side of the 5000-key arm are
the control that says the +15.7% is the work and not drift.
